乃不敢言，还，因具启凯，故辍止。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0079","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0022"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-wu061-luyin-2","subject_person_id":"a7e_y62_4rv_A","object_person_id":"61q_ogq_ueq_A","predicate":"agnatic_cousin","qualifiers":{"source_term":"與從兄禕"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-061","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-luyin","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-061-luyin","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-luyin:line072","quote":"　　胤率，子式嗣。為柴桑督、揚武將軍。天策元年，與從兄禕俱徙建安。天紀二年，召還建業，復將軍、候。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-luyin:line072:m0006","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-luyin:line072:m0027"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"t-wu061-t-wu061-lukai16","person_id":"61q_ogq_ueq_A","kind":"office","title":"黃門侍郎","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-061","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-061-lukai","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line044","quote":"　　子禕。初為黃門侍郎，出領部曲，拜偏將軍。凱亡後，入為太子中庶子。右國史華覈表薦禕曰：\"禕體質方剛，器干強固，董率之才，魯肅不過。及被召當下，逕還赴都，道由武昌，曾不回顧，器械軍資，一無所取，在戎果毅，臨財有節。夫夏口，賊之沖要，直選名將以鎮戍之，臣竊思惟，莫善於禕。\"","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line044:m0003"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu061-t-wu061-lukai16:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line044","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line044:m0003","start":7,"end":11,"surface":"黃門侍郎","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null},